# 默认：仓库内统一存储 LF，检出也使用 LF（不依赖本机 core.autocrlf）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止任何换行转换与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.wav binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.safetensors binary
*.parquet binary

# 语言统计：把这些标记为文档，不计入代码行数
*.md linguist-documentation
AGENTS.md linguist-documentation

# lockfile 一律按文本 diff：全局 `* text=auto eol=lf` 已经保证。
# 不要写 `-diff`——它把文件当二进制，`git diff` 打 "Binary files ... differ"、
# GitHub 显示 "Binary file not shown"，与"让 lockfile 在 diff 中可见"正好相反。
# （原先的两条 `package-lock.json -diff` / `pnpm-lock.yaml -diff` 既是反向的，
#  也早已失效：本仓库的锁文件是 requirements.lock，这两个文件根本不存在。）
